d for now, but I do want the toast to support autowrap, instead of just cutting off the text.\r\n\r\n> 2. Maybe this is intended, but now there's no \"hide progressbar\" (idk how to call it properly):\r\n\r\nFixed, has a slightly ugly border when progress goes down, will fix soon.\r\n\r\n> 3. As a suggestion - do not autohide notifications not only when they are hovered by mouse, but also when clear/silence buttons are hovered.\r\n\r\nDone!\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4105896369/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4115669416","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117700#issuecomment-4115669416","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117700","id":4115669416,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc71UCGo","user":{"login":"jaydensipe","id":47132280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTMyMjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47132280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe","html_url":"https://github.com/jaydensipe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"cre