/117700#issuecomment-4264903545","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117700","id":4264903545,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-NUN5","user":{"login":"jaydensipe","id":47132280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTMyMjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47132280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe","html_url":"https://github.com/jaydensipe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-17T02:37:38Z","updated_at":"2026-04-17T02:38:37Z","body":"Added documentation and refactored size to use custom_maximum_size. Also added 2 questions to the PR's description.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4264903545/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4269276360","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117700#issuecomment-4269276360","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117700","id":4269276360,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-d_zI","user":{"login":"F3der1co","id":89512047,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NTEyMDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89512047?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co","html_url":"https://github.com/F3der1co","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-17T15:24:42Z","updated_at":"2026-04-17T15:40:23Z","body":"I feel like the message/error/warning icon should be aligned to the top instead of the center when the toast has multiple lines.\r\n\r\nI am a bit worried that adding more features to the toasts means we get even more and even larger toasts in future. As the toasts go over the workspace they can be fairly disruptive when spammed or large. But this is not really against the PR itself, more so about how it will be used.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4269276360/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4275345290","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117700#issuecomment-4275345290","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117700","id":4275345290,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-1JeK","user":{"login":"jaydensipe","id":47132280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTMyMjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47132280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe","html_url":"https://github.com/jaydensipe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-19T06:31:42Z","updated_at":"2026-04-19T06:31:42Z","body":"> I feel like the message/error/warning icon should be aligned to the top instead of the center when the toast has multiple lines.\r\n> \r\n> I am a bit worried that adding more features to the toasts means we get even more and even larger toasts in future. As the toasts go over the workspace they can be fairly disruptive when spammed or large. But this is not really against the PR itself, more so about how it will be used.\r\n\r\nI did some research on styling and found it can be both ways, I did go with the center as the buttons on the right are aligned to the center as well, although both could change. It looked a little strange as the text was slightly lower than the icon as well.\r\n\r\nAnd yeah, toast spam can be annoying, although I think it depends on how it is used. Right now it limits the x-axis size to around 1/3 of the Editor window, and can only display a max of 4 lines before the text is cut off, so we can play with this number if these seem too spam heavy.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url